# No hyphens in copy

Never use hyphens (`-`), en dashes, or em dashes in visitor facing text: titles, descriptions, buttons, captions, reviews, blog copy, and Sanity fields.

Rewrite instead of hyphenating.

```text
❌ eco-friendly, well-equipped, 1-2 hours, check-in, Puerto Viejo - Costa Rica
✅ eco friendly, well equipped, 1 to 2 hours, check in, Puerto Viejo, Costa Rica
```

Keep hyphens only in code: URLs, slugs, CSS class names, file paths, and IDs.
